 "summary": "A single P-channel MOSFET built on a dense trench process, rated -30 V drain to source and ±25 V gate to source, in an 8-lead 5 mm × 6 mm DFN. On-resistance is 6.4 mΩ max with -10 V of gate drive and 12 mΩ max at -4.5 V. Its listed uses are point-of-load synchronous buck converters for motherboards, notebooks, UMPCs and graphics cards, networking DC-DC supplies and load switches. Every part is avalanche tested to 88 mJ.",
